      "short": "A book of communist theory that the student communists' reading group has worked through; its title is a pun on the reál, the currency.",
      "details": "Steban lists it among the texts the group has read, just before Wertmüller's 'The Mega-Structure of History'. Conceptualization remarks that communist theorists love puns. The Echo Maker grumbles that the new translation is garbage.",
