      "term": "Rietveldt",
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "An anodic music pioneer; the punks on the plaza name him alongside Arno van Eyck as a true artist of the future.",
      "details": "Fuck the World uses him as the highest praise for his friend Cindy the SKULL. Noid brings him up too, as one of the famous people nobody accuses of mass murder."
