      "term": "Sad FM",
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A radio station that plays sad, slow rock songs; your detective seems to know its frequency by heart.",
      "details": "Inland Empire can't resist urging you to tune in, and Kim agrees to 'blast' it with a resigned shrug.",
      "spoiler": "You can play it on the motor skiff on the way to the island. The old man you meet there hates the station, calling its songs counter-revolutionary dirges.",
