      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "Samaran boxing: a graceful, violent one-on-one fighting style from the Samaran isola; 'Sam Bo style' means stealth, cleverness and cool.",
      "details": "It once covered a wide range of martial disciplines, from archery to mounted combat, but today it mostly means elegant single combat. Your skills use the phrase whenever you pull off something slick, such as trying to slip away from Garte without settling your debt; Garte is sarcastically unimpressed.\n\nKlaasje admits she is no trained Sam Bo fighter.",
      "inspiredBy": "The name echoes sambo, a Soviet martial art.",
