      "term": "Speedfreaks FM",
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A dance-music radio station hosted by DJ Mesh, which turns up in a strange radio mystery on the coast.",
      "details": "It is saved as the favourite station on the radio of Kim's motor carriage, though he would rather not talk about it.\n\nTwo boys in the fishing village seem to have heard Speedfreaks FM without any radio, which sets off a small side mystery.",
