      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A local sports team that keeps losing; Titus Hardie thinks they can't play at all.",
      "details": "In an Esprit de Corps vision, a policeman checks the box scores and sees they lost again, 17-32. Kim jokes that he would have to grow ten centimetres to play flanker for them.",
