      "short": "A book by M. Thibault, the last title listed on the soggy library card found on a dead man on the boardwalk.",
      "details": "The card's owner was clearly a keen reader: the list also includes 'Radiothriller' and 'Stand a Little Less Between Me and the Sun', and a library stamp shows The Glinting Curve was returned. The title helps you work out whose card it is.",
      "spoiler": "The Working Class Woman in the apartment building recognises it as her own book; her husband had gone to return it to the library."
