      ],
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A hugely popular interisolary motor racing series, famous for its speed, its absurd sponsorship deals and its many deaths; Kim is a fan.",
      "details": "In Revachol the Tournée is held every four years at the Zéro Carrousel racing circuit. Kim, who adores his own motor carriage, perks up if you say you like TipTop, and Harry can mock his outfit as that of a 'washed-up TipTop racer'.\n\nThe bookstore sells 'High Speed Love', a biography of the madcap champion driver Jacob Irw. The communist journal La Fumée runs a long essay condemning the races as a capitalist ritual of brands and destruction.",
