      "term": "Truth Hunt",
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A popular radio show about cryptids, conspiracy theories and fringe history. Gary the Cryptofascist gets his ideas from it.",
      "details": "Each week its two eccentric hosts cover everything from cryptids to ethnic warfare and the 'historical' Man from Hjelmdall. Encyclopedia calls it the radio counterpart of the Graadian fringe science magazine 'Paradox B'.",
