      "caseSensitive": true,
      "short": "A dusty, broken pinball machine at the Whirling-in-Rags, themed on early airships and beautiful, sad, pearl-laden women of the Dolorian age.",
      "details": "Kim guesses it's about Messina in the Dolorian era and finds history-themed pinball inane. Encyclopedia explains that Deora was one of the three Crown Cities of the Dolorian era on the Mundi isola, alongside Rheasilvia and Advesperascit. None of these machines work; the only working one is the Royalist Pinball in the main hall.",
